<thead><tr><th scope="col">Setting（情境）</th><th scope="col">Treatment（治療）</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>First-line treatment</td><td>Aspirin（<strong class="ex-n">100–325 mg</strong>）and dipyridamole（<strong class="ex-n">3 × 400 mg</strong>）</td></tr>
<tr><td>Second-line treatment</td><td>Heparin and other anticoagulation strategies</td></tr>
<tr><td>Unresponsive or acutely ill patients</td><td>Intravenous immunoglobulins（<strong class="ex-n">1 g/kg/day for 2 days</strong> or <strong class="ex-n">0.4 g/kg/day for 5 days</strong>）；Eculizumab、treprostinil</td></tr>
